OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,APrue Leith: 'You come into your own
OL,4,Agrowing old'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe trio will take to the stage at this
OL,7,Fyear's Cheltenham Literature Festival
OL,8,Fon 15 October to prove to the audience
OL,9,Fageing is "not the dreaded thing" it is
OL,10,Fmade out to be, the former Bake Off
OL,11,Fjudge said.
OL,13,FDame Prue said: "You come into your
OL,14,Fown, you don't care what people think,
OL,15,Fyou're not going to change. And so the
OL,16,Fworld has to just put up with it."
